{"schemaVersion": 1, "cardId": "teyvat.world.overview.001", "canon": "teyvat", "type": "world", "title": "提瓦特与七国", "summary": "提瓦特是七国并立的大陆：蒙德·风、璃月·岩、稻妻·雷、须弥·草、枫丹·水、纳塔·火、至冬·冰。七种元素各由一位魔神执掌，其更本源的称谓是「尘世七执政」。", "evidence": ["人们所说的七神，更本源的称谓是「尘世七执政」。划分尘世、各自统治七分之一。", "目前一共存在7种元素，作为基本元素。"], "characters": [], "locations": [], "factions": [], "aliases": ["提瓦特大陆", "七国"], "timeRange": {"from": null, "to": "序章·第一幕"}, "versionRange": {"from": null, "to": "1.0"}, "knowledgeScope": {"level": "public", "allow": [], "deny": []}, "claimType": "derived_summary", "reliability": "primary", "spoilerLevel": "序章·第一幕", "sources": [{"sourceId": "S011", "url": "https://wiki.biligame.com/ys/北陆图书馆", "work": "北陆图书馆", "locator": "1.6.1 尘世七执政"}, {"sourceId": "S067", "url": "https://wiki.biligame.com/ys/元素", "work": "元素", "locator": "1.1 元素"}]}
{"schemaVersion": 1, "cardId": "teyvat.world.elements.002", "canon": "teyvat", "type": "world", "title": "七种元素", "summary": "提瓦特的基本元素为火、水、雷、冰、风、岩、草七种。据传世界本来的力量是荒蛮的光界力，后被「天理」改造为七种更温和、便于人使用的元素力。", "evidence": ["基本元素：火、水、雷、冰、风、岩、草。", "提瓦特的力量原本是荒蛮的光界力，后来被天理改造成更温和方便人们使用的七元素力。"], "characters": [], "locations": [], "factions": [], "aliases": ["七元素", "元素力"], "timeRange": {"from": null, "to": "序章·第一幕"}, "versionRange": {"from": null, "to": "1.0"}, "knowledgeScope": {"level": "public", "allow": [], "deny": []}, "claimType": "derived_summary", "reliability": "primary", "spoilerLevel": "序章·第一幕", "sources": [{"sourceId": "S067", "url": "https://wiki.biligame.com/ys/元素", "work": "元素", "locator": "1.1 元素"}, {"sourceId": "S011", "url": "https://wiki.biligame.com/ys/北陆图书馆", "work": "北陆图书馆", "locator": "13.2 天理"}]}
{"schemaVersion": 1, "cardId": "teyvat.world.vision.003", "canon": "teyvat", "type": "world", "title": "神之眼", "summary": "神之眼是人被分封支配权碎屑、获得成神资格的凭证，由七位执政为渴望通达上天者降下。持有者即「原神」；「神之眼…也是一种『契约』」，力量皆有其代价。", "evidence": ["七神仍需分封出自身支配权的碎屑赐予其人。", "「神之眼」…也是一种「契约」。须知一切力量皆有其代价。"], "characters": [], "locations": [], "factions": [], "aliases": ["神之眼", "原神", "月之轮"], "timeRange": {"from": null, "to": "序章·第一幕"}, "versionRange": {"from": null, "to": "1.0"}, "knowledgeScope": {"level": "public", "allow": [], "deny": []}, "claimType": "derived_summary", "reliability": "primary", "spoilerLevel": "序章·第一幕", "sources": [{"sourceId": "S068", "url": "https://wiki.biligame.com/ys/神之眼", "work": "神之眼", "locator": "简介"}]}
{"schemaVersion": 1, "cardId": "teyvat.world.gnosis.004", "canon": "teyvat", "type": "world", "title": "神之心与神座", "summary": "神之心是一种魔力器官，可视为强大的武器或能源；尘世七执政的席位与「神座」绑定，因此失去神之心的七神仍是七神的一员。神之心由第三降临者的遗骨制成。", "evidence": ["神之心是一种魔力器官，可视为强大的武器/能源。", "失去神之心的七神仍然是七神的一员。", "第三降临者已经逝去，遗骨被制成【神之心】。"], "characters": [], "locations": [], "factions": [], "aliases": ["神之心", "神座"], "timeRange": {"from": null, "to": "序章·第一幕"}, "versionRange": {"from": null, "to": "1.0"}, "knowledgeScope": {"level": "public", "allow": [], "deny": []}, "claimType": "derived_summary", "reliability": "primary", "spoilerLevel": "序章·第一幕", "sources": [{"sourceId": "S011", "url": "https://wiki.biligame.com/ys/北陆图书馆", "work": "北陆图书馆", "locator": "1.6.1 尘世七执政"}, {"sourceId": "S069", "url": "https://wiki.biligame.com/ys/魔神", "work": "魔神", "locator": "魔神"}]}
{"schemaVersion": 1, "cardId": "teyvat.location.mondstadt.001", "canon": "teyvat", "type": "location", "title": "蒙德", "summary": "蒙德是风之国，被称作「北地明冠、自由之都」。风神巴巴托斯为蒙德的神；城邦由西风骑士团综务与卫戍。蒙德是蒙德地区风花节、羽球节、归风佳酿节等自由主题节庆的所在。", "evidence": ["风花节，发源于「北地明冠、自由之都」。", "风神还将智慧与力量悉心传授。他建造风车，教会人们加工粮食、酿造美酒。"], "characters": ["zhongli"], "locations": ["mondstadt"], "factions": ["knights_of_favonius"], "aliases": ["风之国", "自由之都", "蒙德城"], "timeRange": {"from": null, "to": "序章·第一幕"}, "versionRange": {"from": null, "to": "1.0"}, "knowledgeScope": {"level": "public", "allow": [], "deny": []}, "claimType": "derived_summary", "reliability": "primary", "spoilerLevel": "序章·第一幕", "sources": [{"sourceId": "S055", "url": "https://wiki.biligame.com/ys/蒙德", "work": "蒙德", "locator": "6.5.1 巴巴托斯"}, {"sourceId": "S214", "url": "https://wiki.biligame.com/ys/风花节", "work": "风花节", "locator": "基本信息"}]}
{"schemaVersion": 1, "cardId": "teyvat.location.liyue.002", "canon": "teyvat", "type": "location", "title": "璃月", "summary": "璃月是岩之国，以港口城市璃月港为中心。岩王帝君为璃月的神，订立规则与契约；璃月设七星八门掌律法与请仙典仪，辖千岩军。", "evidence": ["岩王帝君订立规则与契约，却不强迫凡人以权威的完美模板生活。", "故岩王帝君迁其民入天衡之南。"], "characters": ["zhongli"], "locations": ["liyue"], "factions": ["liyue_qixing", "millelith"], "aliases": ["璃月港", "岩之国"], "timeRange": {"from": null, "to": "序章·第一幕"}, "versionRange": {"from": null, "to": "1.0"}, "knowledgeScope": {"level": "public", "allow": [], "deny": []}, "claimType": "derived_summary", "reliability": "primary", "spoilerLevel": "序章·第一幕", "sources": [{"sourceId": "S056", "url": "https://wiki.biligame.com/ys/璃月", "work": "璃月", "locator": "5.1.4 七星"}, {"sourceId": "S070", "url": "https://wiki.biligame.com/ys/摩拉", "work": "摩拉", "locator": "基本信息"}]}
{"schemaVersion": 1, "cardId": "teyvat.location.inazuma.003", "canon": "teyvat", "type": "location", "title": "稻妻", "summary": "稻妻是雷之国，由雷电将军统治，设社奉行、天领奉行、勘定奉行三奉行分掌治安、财政与神里家事。愚人众蛊惑两奉行进言，促成了锁国令与眼狩令。", "evidence": ["稻妻设三奉行，分别为社奉行、天领奉行和勘定奉行。", "愚人众蛊惑天领奉行九条孝行和勘定奉行柊慎介，向雷电将军建言颁布锁国令和眼狩令。"], "characters": ["raiden_shogun"], "locations": ["inazuma"], "factions": ["tri_commission"], "aliases": ["雷之国", "鸣神岛", "稻妻城"], "timeRange": {"from": null, "to": "第二章·第一幕"}, "versionRange": {"from": null, "to": "2.0"}, "knowledgeScope": {"level": "public", "allow": [], "deny": []}, "claimType": "derived_summary", "reliability": "primary", "spoilerLevel": "第二章·第一幕", "sources": [{"sourceId": "S057", "url": "https://wiki.biligame.com/ys/稻妻", "work": "稻妻", "locator": "15.2 锁国令"}, {"sourceId": "S064", "url": "https://wiki.biligame.com/ys/三奉行", "work": "三奉行", "locator": "社奉行"}]}
{"schemaVersion": 1, "cardId": "teyvat.location.sumeru.004", "canon": "teyvat", "type": "location", "title": "须弥", "summary": "须弥是草之国，求知者的灵囿，最高学术机构为教令院。国土兼有雨林与沙漠，地下倒挂着记录提瓦特记忆的世界树。新生草神一度被教令院囚禁。", "evidence": ["求知者的灵囿，是须弥最高的学术机构。", "新生草神被教令院囚禁。"], "characters": ["nahida"], "locations": ["sumeru"], "factions": ["akademiya"], "aliases": ["草之国", "须弥城"], "timeRange": {"from": null, "to": "第三章·第一幕"}, "versionRange": {"from": null, "to": "3.0"}, "knowledgeScope": {"level": "public", "allow": [], "deny": []}, "claimType": "derived_summary", "reliability": "primary", "spoilerLevel": "第三章·第一幕", "sources": [{"sourceId": "S058", "url": "https://wiki.biligame.com/ys/须弥", "work": "须弥", "locator": "6.3.1 新生草神被教令院囚禁"}, {"sourceId": "S063", "url": "https://wiki.biligame.com/ys/须弥教令院", "work": "须弥教令院", "locator": "介绍"}]}
{"schemaVersion": 1, "cardId": "teyvat.location.fontaine.005", "canon": "teyvat", "type": "location", "title": "枫丹", "summary": "枫丹是水之国。前代水神厄歌莉娅僭越天理权柄造人，天理降下预言：枫丹人将被上涨的原始胎海溶解。枫丹设审判庭与科学院。", "evidence": ["「天理」降下预言，枫丹人将会被上涨的原始胎海溶解。", "枫丹这块土地被称为「梅洛皮斯」。"], "characters": ["furina"], "locations": ["fontaine"], "factions": ["fontaine_tribunal"], "aliases": ["水之国", "枫丹廷"], "timeRange": {"from": null, "to": "第四章·第一幕"}, "versionRange": {"from": null, "to": "4.0"}, "knowledgeScope": {"level": "public", "allow": [], "deny": []}, "claimType": "derived_summary", "reliability": "primary", "spoilerLevel": "第四章·第一幕", "sources": [{"sourceId": "S059", "url": "https://wiki.biligame.com/ys/枫丹", "work": "枫丹", "locator": "降下预言"}]}
{"schemaVersion": 1, "cardId": "teyvat.location.natlan.006", "canon": "teyvat", "type": "location", "title": "纳塔", "summary": "纳塔是火之国，由六部族组成。火龙王修库特尔死后，希巴拉克取得古龙大权成为初代火神，故纳塔历代火神皆由人担任。夜神之国由夜神以旧地脉残片重构。", "evidence": ["火龙王死时希巴拉克获得古龙大权成为初代火神。这也是纳塔的火神历代都是人的原因。", "夜神整合旧地脉的残片，重构其脉络，「夜神之国」由此诞生。"], "characters": [], "locations": ["natlan"], "factions": ["six_tribes"], "aliases": ["火之国"], "timeRange": {"from": null, "to": "第五章·第一幕"}, "versionRange": {"from": null, "to": "5.0"}, "knowledgeScope": {"level": "public", "allow": [], "deny": []}, "claimType": "derived_summary", "reliability": "primary", "spoilerLevel": "第五章·第一幕", "sources": [{"sourceId": "S060", "url": "https://wiki.biligame.com/ys/纳塔", "work": "纳塔", "locator": "3.8 希巴拉克"}]}
{"schemaVersion": 1, "cardId": "teyvat.location.snezhnaya.007", "canon": "teyvat", "type": "location", "title": "至冬", "summary": "至冬是冰之国，国都至冬堡。冰之女皇加冕后组建愚人众并设十一执行官，命其秉承己意在世界各地活动。冒险家协会总部亦设于至冬。", "evidence": ["来自至冬国的组织，在500年前由现任「冰之女皇」创立。", "总部位于至冬，在每个国家的主城都设有窗口。"], "characters": [], "locations": ["snezhnaya"], "factions": ["fatui"], "aliases": ["冰之国", "至冬堡"], "timeRange": {"from": null, "to": "序章·第一幕"}, "versionRange": {"from": null, "to": "1.0"}, "knowledgeScope": {"level": "public", "allow": [], "deny": []}, "claimType": "derived_summary", "reliability": "primary", "spoilerLevel": "序章·第一幕", "sources": [{"sourceId": "S061", "url": "https://wiki.biligame.com/ys/至冬", "work": "至冬", "locator": "7.3.2 组建「愚人众」"}, {"sourceId": "S066", "url": "https://wiki.biligame.com/ys/冒险家协会", "work": "冒险家协会", "locator": "介绍"}, {"sourceId": "S065", "url": "https://wiki.biligame.com/ys/愚人众", "work": "愚人众", "locator": "愚人众"}]}
{"schemaVersion": 1, "cardId": "teyvat.faction.fatui.001", "canon": "teyvat", "type": "faction", "title": "愚人众", "summary": "愚人众是至冬国组织，五百年前由现任冰之女皇创立，隶属「至冬宫」，听从女皇命令并在世界各地活动。下设十一执行官，席位靠前者实力堪比神明。", "evidence": ["来自至冬国的组织，在500年前由现任「冰之女皇」创立。", "第三席及之上的愚人众执行官都有着堪比神明的实力。"], "characters": ["raiden_shogun"], "locations": [], "factions": ["fatui"], "aliases": ["十一执行官", "Fatui"], "timeRange": {"from": null, "to": "序章·第一幕"}, "versionRange": {"from": null, "to": "1.0"}, "knowledgeScope": {"level": "public", "allow": [], "deny": []}, "claimType": "derived_summary", "reliability": "primary", "spoilerLevel": "序章·第一幕", "sources": [{"sourceId": "S065", "url": "https://wiki.biligame.com/ys/愚人众", "work": "愚人众", "locator": "十一执行官"}, {"sourceId": "S061", "url": "https://wiki.biligame.com/ys/至冬", "work": "至冬", "locator": "7.3.2 组建「愚人众」"}]}
{"schemaVersion": 1, "cardId": "teyvat.faction.knights.002", "canon": "teyvat", "type": "faction", "title": "西风骑士团", "summary": "西风骑士团是蒙德的卫戍与综务机构，由被授予狮或狼之名的骑士担任团长。大团长法尔伽带兵远征挪德卡莱期间，由副团长琴代行团长一职。", "evidence": ["大团长「北风骑士」法尔伽。", "副团长「蒲公英骑士」琴·古恩希尔德。"], "characters": [], "locations": ["mondstadt"], "factions": ["knights_of_favonius"], "aliases": ["骑士团"], "timeRange": {"from": null, "to": "序章·第一幕"}, "versionRange": {"from": null, "to": "1.0"}, "knowledgeScope": {"level": "public", "allow": [], "deny": []}, "claimType": "derived_summary", "reliability": "primary", "spoilerLevel": "序章·第一幕", "sources": [{"sourceId": "S062", "url": "https://wiki.biligame.com/ys/西风骑士团", "work": "西风骑士团", "locator": "组成"}]}
{"schemaVersion": 1, "cardId": "teyvat.faction.akademiya.003", "canon": "teyvat", "type": "faction", "title": "须弥教令院", "summary": "须弥教令院是须弥最高学术机构，设生论、明论、素论、知论、因论、妙论六大学派，各由一位贤者掌管，六贤者中推举大贤者统辖全院。风纪官负责抓捕违反教令者。", "evidence": ["求知者的灵囿，是须弥最高的学术机构。", "教令院中包含六大学派，分别依托于六大学院。"], "characters": ["nahida"], "locations": ["sumeru"], "factions": ["akademiya"], "aliases": ["教令院", "大贤者"], "timeRange": {"from": null, "to": "第三章·第一幕"}, "versionRange": {"from": null, "to": "3.0"}, "knowledgeScope": {"level": "public", "allow": [], "deny": []}, "claimType": "derived_summary", "reliability": "primary", "spoilerLevel": "第三章·第一幕", "sources": [{"sourceId": "S063", "url": "https://wiki.biligame.com/ys/须弥教令院", "work": "须弥教令院", "locator": "介绍"}]}
{"schemaVersion": 1, "cardId": "teyvat.faction.tri_commission.004", "canon": "teyvat", "type": "faction", "title": "稻妻三奉行", "summary": "三奉行是管理稻妻各项事务的机构：社奉行（神里家）掌祭祀与庆典，天领奉行（九条家）掌治安与通行，勘定奉行（柊家）掌税收财政与离岛管理。", "evidence": ["「三奉行」，负责管理稻妻各项事务的机构。", "稻妻的财务中枢，负责国家税收和财政。"], "characters": ["raiden_shogun"], "locations": ["inazuma"], "factions": ["tri_commission"], "aliases": ["社奉行", "天领奉行", "勘定奉行"], "timeRange": {"from": null, "to": "第二章·第一幕"}, "versionRange": {"from": null, "to": "2.0"}, "knowledgeScope": {"level": "public", "allow": [], "deny": []}, "claimType": "derived_summary", "reliability": "primary", "spoilerLevel": "第二章·第一幕", "sources": [{"sourceId": "S064", "url": "https://wiki.biligame.com/ys/三奉行", "work": "三奉行", "locator": "三奉行"}]}
{"schemaVersion": 1, "cardId": "teyvat.history.ancient.001", "canon": "teyvat", "type": "history", "title": "葬火之战与降下天钉", "summary": "约六千年前，第二王座尼伯龙根带禁忌知识归来，与天理爆发葬火之战。战后天空岛降下修补大地的「天钉」以阻绝禁忌知识在地脉中扩散，许多古文明因此覆灭。", "evidence": ["葬火之战的年代被称为葬火之年。", "葬火之战后，天空岛降下了修补大地的天钉，以此阻绝禁忌知识在地脉中的扩散。"], "characters": [], "locations": [], "factions": [], "aliases": ["葬火之战", "降下天钉", "天钉"], "timeRange": {"from": null, "to": "序章·第一幕"}, "versionRange": {"from": null, "to": "1.0"}, "knowledgeScope": {"level": "public", "allow": [], "deny": []}, "claimType": "derived_summary", "reliability": "primary", "spoilerLevel": "序章·第一幕", "sources": [{"sourceId": "S012", "url": "https://wiki.biligame.com/ys/提瓦特编年史", "work": "提瓦特编年史", "locator": "2.5 葬火之战（约6000年前）"}, {"sourceId": "S012", "url": "https://wiki.biligame.com/ys/提瓦特编年史", "work": "提瓦特编年史", "locator": "2.7 降下天钉"}, {"sourceId": "S011", "url": "https://wiki.biligame.com/ys/北陆图书馆", "work": "北陆图书馆", "locator": "葬火之战"}]}
{"schemaVersion": 1, "cardId": "teyvat.history.archon_war.002", "canon": "teyvat", "type": "history", "title": "魔神战争与尘世七执政", "summary": "天理命魔神互相吞并、决胜出七位胜者，即魔神战争。战争于约两千年前终结，七位魔神各登「神」之座，加冕为尘世七执政，在败者残骸上建立国度与城邦。", "evidence": ["旷日持久的战争直到两千年前方才终结。…最终，提瓦特只剩下七位胜利者。", "他们在败者的残骸上建立国度与城邦，开始了七神的时代。"], "characters": [], "locations": [], "factions": [], "aliases": ["魔神战争"], "timeRange": {"from": null, "to": "序章·第一幕"}, "versionRange": {"from": null, "to": "1.0"}, "knowledgeScope": {"level": "public", "allow": [], "deny": []}, "claimType": "derived_summary", "reliability": "primary", "spoilerLevel": "序章·第一幕", "sources": [{"sourceId": "S012", "url": "https://wiki.biligame.com/ys/提瓦特编年史", "work": "提瓦特编年史", "locator": "7.1.1 魔神战争结束"}, {"sourceId": "S069", "url": "https://wiki.biligame.com/ys/魔神", "work": "魔神", "locator": "魔神"}]}
{"schemaVersion": 1, "cardId": "teyvat.history.khaenriah.003", "canon": "teyvat", "type": "history", "title": "坎瑞亚覆灭", "summary": "约五百年前，不信仰神的无神国度坎瑞亚妄图以深渊之力取代既有能源，深渊失控。天理与七神前往覆灭坎瑞亚，遗民被变成非人的生物，即后来的深渊教团。", "evidence": ["天理与七神对坎瑞亚降下了不公的审判，导致坎瑞亚王国的覆灭。", "将坎瑞亚遗民变成了非人的生物，这就是后来被称为深渊教团的组织。"], "characters": [], "locations": ["khaenriah"], "factions": [], "aliases": ["坎瑞亚"], "timeRange": {"from": null, "to": "序章·第一幕"}, "versionRange": {"from": null, "to": "1.0"}, "knowledgeScope": {"level": "public", "allow": [], "deny": []}, "claimType": "derived_summary", "reliability": "primary", "spoilerLevel": "序章·第一幕", "sources": [{"sourceId": "S012", "url": "https://wiki.biligame.com/ys/提瓦特编年史", "work": "提瓦特编年史", "locator": "2.8 坎瑞亚"}]}
{"schemaVersion": 1, "cardId": "teyvat.culture.mora.001", "canon": "teyvat", "type": "culture", "title": "摩拉与黄金屋", "summary": "摩拉是通行大陆的通用货币，由岩神以神之心将自己的血肉转化铸成。黄金屋是全大陆唯一的铸币厂，制作摩拉必须借助「岩神之心」的力量。", "evidence": ["通行大陆的钱。世界通用的共同语言，谁人都能理解的贵金属。", "黄金屋是全大陆唯一的铸币厂，制作摩拉时必须借助「岩神之心」的力量。"], "characters": ["zhongli"], "locations": ["liyue"], "factions": ["liyue_qixing"], "aliases": ["摩拉", "黄金屋"], "timeRange": {"from": null, "to": "第一章·第一幕"}, "versionRange": {"from": null, "to": "1.0"}, "knowledgeScope": {"level": "public", "allow": [], "deny": []}, "claimType": "derived_summary", "reliability": "primary", "spoilerLevel": "第一章·第一幕", "sources": [{"sourceId": "S070", "url": "https://wiki.biligame.com/ys/摩拉", "work": "摩拉", "locator": "基本信息"}, {"sourceId": "S056", "url": "https://wiki.biligame.com/ys/璃月", "work": "璃月", "locator": "5.1.2 摩拉"}, {"sourceId": "S011", "url": "https://wiki.biligame.com/ys/北陆图书馆", "work": "北陆图书馆", "locator": "黄金屋"}]}
{"schemaVersion": 1, "cardId": "teyvat.culture.lantern_rite.002", "canon": "teyvat", "type": "culture", "title": "海灯节与逐月节", "summary": "海灯节是璃月一年一度纪念护佑璃月英雄的节日，每年第一个月圆之夜人们放飞「霄灯」与「明霄灯」，寓意「愿薪火相传，美德不灭」。逐月节则由岩王帝君为纪念灶神而统合诸节而成。", "evidence": ["这是一个纪念英雄的节日，在夜里，人们会放出「霄灯」和「明霄灯」，升上夜空。", "岩王帝君为了纪念灶神，将这些节日统合起来，是为「逐月节」。"], "characters": ["zhongli"], "locations": ["liyue"], "factions": [], "aliases": ["海灯节", "霄灯", "明霄灯", "逐月节"], "timeRange": {"from": null, "to": "第一章·第一幕"}, "versionRange": {"from": null, "to": "1.0"}, "knowledgeScope": {"level": "public", "allow": [], "deny": []}, "claimType": "derived_summary", "reliability": "primary", "spoilerLevel": "第一章·第一幕", "sources": [{"sourceId": "S213", "url": "https://wiki.biligame.com/ys/海灯节", "work": "海灯节", "locator": "历史沿革"}, {"sourceId": "S215", "url": "https://wiki.biligame.com/ys/逐月节", "work": "逐月节", "locator": "历史沿革"}]}
{"schemaVersion": 1, "cardId": "teyvat.culture.windblume.003", "canon": "teyvat", "type": "culture", "title": "风花节与蒙德节庆", "summary": "风花节是蒙德属于自由与爱情的节日，人们向风神献上「风之花」。「风之花」最初是旧蒙德人民共约反抗的暗语；蒙德另有羽球节与归风佳酿节。", "evidence": ["风花节是蒙德传统中一个属于自由和爱情的节日。", "「风之花」这个词语，最初只是旧蒙德时代，人民之间相互联络、共约反抗的暗语。"], "characters": [], "locations": ["mondstadt"], "factions": [], "aliases": ["风花节", "风之花", "羽球节", "归风佳酿节"], "timeRange": {"from": null, "to": "序章·第一幕"}, "versionRange": {"from": null, "to": "1.0"}, "knowledgeScope": {"level": "public", "allow": [], "deny": []}, "claimType": "derived_summary", "reliability": "primary", "spoilerLevel": "序章·第一幕", "sources": [{"sourceId": "S214", "url": "https://wiki.biligame.com/ys/风花节", "work": "风花节", "locator": "基本信息"}, {"sourceId": "S218", "url": "https://wiki.biligame.com/ys/羽球节", "work": "羽球节", "locator": "基本信息"}, {"sourceId": "S217", "url": "https://wiki.biligame.com/ys/归风佳酿节", "work": "归风佳酿节", "locator": "基本信息"}]}
